      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "- Commit history is read live. It is never written by the app.\n- Only .local-repos.json is persisted, mapping owner/repo to a local path.\n- Limits: 8s read deadline, 3s git timeout, 5s config cache, 30s discovery cache.\n- Local unpushed commits are prepended to GitHub commits and flagged local: true.\n- GitHub history is separate: history-model.ts feeds the same history dialog.",
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 136694917,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "text": "- Commit history is read live. It is never written by the app.\n- Only .local-repos.json is persisted, mapping owner/repo to a local path.\n- Limits: 8s read deadline, 3s git timeout, 5s config cache, 30s discovery cache.\n- Local unpushed commits are prepended to GitHub commits and flagged local: true.\n- GitHub history is separate: history-model.ts feeds the same history dialog.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "updated": 1795115484112,
      "version": 1,
